<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="title">咨询后反馈</view><view class="sub">请填写实际已付金额；双方都提交相同金额后，预约流程才会完成。</view><input class="field" type="digit" placeholder="实际已付金额（元）" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="changeAmount"/><textarea class="field" placeholder="本次咨询反馈（选填）" value="{{feedback}}" bindinput="changeFeedback"/><button class="btn btn-primary" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交并确认金额</button></view></view>
